<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">- Doondo</book>
  <para style="toc3">Fil</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filipi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda wu Pawuli ku bisi-Filipi</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukanda wusonika Pawuli ku bisi-</para>
  <para style="mt1">FILIPI</para>
  <para style="imt">Nkotolo</para>
  <para style="ip">Wu ni mukanda Pawuli wu kasonika ku minkwikidi mii ku mbanza yi Filipi. Mu nzyetolo andi yi nzole, yandi wulonga Musamu Wumbote ku mbanza beyiyi natee bantu ba mbanza beyiyi bakwikila wo. Lulendi tanga mu <char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 16:11-40">Mav 16.11-40</ref></char></para>
  <para style="ip">Bu batuula Pawuli mu boloko mu dyambu ti wusala mu dyambu di Mfumu, bisi-Filipi bayonzika mbongo na batambika muntu wumosi ha kati dyawu wu bedi tumisinanga Epafodite mu munata bima bi bayonzika. Ni mu ntangu beyoyo, Pawuli ka basonikina mu makanda mu bavutudila matondo, mpe wuyena bima bi bamutambika. Na wubateela dyaka ti bakangama nakekete mu kiminu, batekandi Nzambi manima, na bavuminandi yobobo bana longa ndongosolo ziswaswana ku bantu mu myo mitadidi Nzambi. Wubababula moyo ti bahikidi muntu wumosi na Klisto, yidi nyuwasani yifweni ba ha kati dyawu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ndandani yi buuku bedidi ebu yidi:</para>
  <para style="io1">1) Zimbote na lusambulu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 1:1-11">1.1-11</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">2) Bwedi Pawuli kana yenina luzingu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 1:12-30">1.12-30</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">3) Yesu-Klisto wudi nkatika muntu wulembolo ku kizangula (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 2:1-18">2.1-18</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">4) Bwedi bubela Timote na Epafodite (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 2:19-30">2.19-30</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">5) Muntu wufweti yangingidika Nzambi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 3:1-4:9">3.1–4.9</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">6) Pawuli wuvutula matondo ku bisi-Filipi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 4:10-20">4.10-20</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Mbote zimansukina (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 4:21-23">4.21-23</ref></char>)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1" />
  <para style="s1">Zimbote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1" />Meno Pawuli na Timote, bisadi bi Yesu-Klisto, tutambikidi mukanda bewuwu ku bantu bamvimba bavwihulu ku Nzambi mu Yesu-Klisto baa ku mbanza yi Filipi, na ku mintwadisi mpe na minsadisi myawu:<verse eid="PHP 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2" />Bika Nzambi, Tata dyeto na Mfumu eto Yesu-Klisto kalusakumuna na kaluhaana kiyenge!<verse eid="PHP 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawuli vutudi matondo ku Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3" />Nkwe vutulanga matondo ku Nzambi ani, kadi ntangu yi nakwe lubambukilanga moyo, <verse eid="PHP 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4" />ntangu zimvimba zi nakwe lusambidilanga, nakwe sambilanga mu kyese, <verse eid="PHP 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5" />mu dyambu ti lunsadisa mu samuna Musamu Wumbote, kutonina kilumbu kintete natee mu ntangu beyiyi. <verse eid="PHP 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6" />Nina kwikila ti Nzambi wutonini kisalu bekiki kimbote ha kati dyeno, waatatamana kyo natee ku nsukunu, natee kilumbu kyaakwiza Yesu-Klisto. <verse eid="PHP 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7" />Bumbote budi naba na mabanza ma bobobo mu yeno bamvimba. Mu kati di mutima ani ludi, mu dyambu ti yeno bamvimba, lunsadisa mu kisalu kimpaana Nzambi mu mulemvo andi, bu nidi bwabu mu boloko, na buna kwe nwaninanga mu kibakala Musamu Wumbote. <verse eid="PHP 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8" />Nzambi zebi ti nalutiidi bubwingi mu luzolo lu Yesu-Klisto.<verse eid="PHP 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9" />Misamu mi nakwe lusambidilanga ku Nzambi ni emi: luzolo lweno lutoma kula mu nzayilu yimbote na mu madyela, <verse eid="PHP 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10" />mwanki luzaba mu swasikisa misamu mii mfunu. Bwabobo, lwaabela bantu bavedila mpe balembolo ba na dyambu dye basembila mu kilumbu kyaakwiza Yesu-Klisto. <verse eid="PHP 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11" />Lwaaba bafuluka mu mimbutu mi lunungu mi lukwe tambulanga mu Yesu-Klisto, mu kembisa na mu siika Nzambi.<verse eid="PHP 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Musamu Wumbote wumwangana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12" />Zimpangi, ntiidi luzaba ti: misamu mintudidi misidi ti Musamu Wumbote wutoma mwangana. <verse eid="PHP 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13" />Ni hahoho, zimbulu-mbulu zikwe kenganga nzo yi munyadi na bantu bamvimba bihiika, bazebi ti mu boloko nidi mu dyambu di kisalu ki Klisto. <verse eid="PHP 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14" />Mpangi zizingi bu zinyena mu boloko, mpe bu basa kivuvu kyawu mu Mfumu, balwata dyaka kibakala mu samuna Mambu ma Nzambi balembolo ba na bunkuta.<verse eid="PHP 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15" />Wu kedika wudi ti bantu bahiika bana samuna Klisto mu nzinunu na mu mpeve yi kimpala, kansi bahiika bana samuna Klisto mu mabanza mambote. <verse eid="PHP 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16" />Bantu bahiika bana sadila mu luzolo, mu dyambu ti bazebi ti, nidi mu boloko mu nwanina Musamu Wumbote. <verse eid="PHP 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17" />Kansi bahiika dyaka bana samuna Klisto mu mpeve yi kimpala, na mabanza mawu maa mambote ko, bana tya mu mbwesa mpasi bu bu nidi mu boloko.<verse eid="PHP 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18" />Ka musamu ko! Ni basadila bobo mu kibila kimbi hoti kikedika, dyambu dii mfunu ni Klisto bana samuna! Nina kyese mpe nina tatamana mu yena kyese, <verse eid="PHP 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19" />kadi nzebi ti mimvimba bemyomyo myaatwala mpulusu ani, mu dyambu di zinsambulu zeno, mpe na lusadusu lu Mpeve yi Yesu-Klisto. <verse eid="PHP 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20" />Mu dyambu ti, mu myo mi nina kingila mpe mi nsiididi kivuvu, ndendi yena nsoni ko. Kansi, nii na kivuvu ti, bu tusidi bubu natee ntangu zimvimba, naalonka bunene bu Klisto mu nitu ani, ni naba wumoyo hoti wufwa. <verse eid="PHP 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21" />Kedika, mu meno, luzingu ni Klisto, mpe lufwa ni ndandu. <verse eid="PHP 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22" />Kansi tala ti kuzinga kwampaana dyaka luve mu lungisa kisalu kimfunu, buna nzebi ko nki nafweti soola. <verse eid="PHP 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23" />Mayindu mana nwanisa mu ndambu nzole: Ntiidi mu sisa luzingu belulu, mwanki naba kintwadi na Klisto, bwabobo buvudidi bumbote, <verse eid="PHP 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24" />kansi mu dyambu dyeno, buvudidi bumbote natatamana mu zinga ha luse lu butoto. <verse eid="PHP 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25" />Nii na kivuvu ti, naatatamana mu ba neeno, mu lusadisa mu kula mpe mu ba na kyese mu kiminu. <verse eid="PHP 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26" />Ni hahoho, bu naavutuka ku yeno, lwaayangalala bubwingi mu dyambu dyani, mu kintwadi kyeno na Yesu-Klisto .<verse eid="PHP 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27" />Kansi, dyatileeno bonso bufwanakani na Musamu Wumbote wu Klisto. Ni hahoho, ni niza na lutala hoti kaani, mfweti yuwanga ti luu bakangama nakekete mu Mpeve yimosi, mpe luna nwana mu mutima wumosi mu dyambu di kiminu kyeno ki Musamu Wumbote. <verse eid="PHP 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28" />Luyenandi mitantu myeno bunkuta ko. Kyo kyaaba kidimbu kina lonka ti yawu bana zimbala, kansi yeno mu nzila yi mpulusu ludi. Mpe mimvimba bemyomyo mifumini ku Nzambi. <verse eid="PHP 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29" />Mu dyambu ti, lutambula kaka mulemvo we kwikila mu Klisto ko, kansi we yena mpe mpasi mu dyambu dyandi. <verse eid="PHP 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30" />Bwabu luna nwana mvita yimosi naani, yoyoyo yi luyena yi nedi nwana mu ntama, mpe yi nina tatamana mu nwana bwabu bonso bu luzabidi wo.<verse eid="PHP 1:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2" />
  <para style="s1">Klisto wubonga kifwani ki kisadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1" />Tala ti kintwadi kyeno na Klisto kina luhaana kibakala, tala ti zola kwandi kuna lusyamisa, mpe tala ti ludi kintwadi nandi mu Mpeve, tala ti ludi na luzolo na nkenda yeno na yeno, <verse eid="PHP 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2" />buna lungiseeno kyese kyani mu ba na nyuwasani, mu ba na luzolo lumosi, mu ba bakangama mu mutima wumosi mpe mayindu mamosi. <verse eid="PHP 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3" />Lusangandi kima mu mpeve yi kimpala ko hoti mu nsatu ye kiyenikisa ko, kansi mu luyinunu bongileeno bahiika bonso ti baluvudidi kuzangama. <verse eid="PHP 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4" />Muntu kasosandi ndandu yi yandi bende ko, kansi kasosa ndandu yi bahiika. <verse eid="PHP 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5" />Bika mbanzulu zeno ziba bonso zi Yesu-Klisto.<verse eid="PHP 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6" />Tuka ntama Yandi wuba bonso Nzambi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:6">kansi kasosa mu tatamana mu kifwanikisa na Nzambi ko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbadukulu 3.5</char></note>.<verse eid="PHP 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7" />Kansi, wubisa Yandi bende bimvimba biba nandi na wubonga kifwani ki kisadi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesaya52.13-53.12; Matayi 20.28 </char></note>.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:7">Wukituka bonso muntu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:7">mpe wuzabakana bonso muntu,<verse eid="PHP 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8" />wukikulula yandi bende</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:8">na wutumama natee ku lufwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:8">lufwa ha yulu kulunsi.<verse eid="PHP 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9" />Ni hahoho, Nzambi wumuzangula ha kibuka kivudidi kuzangama</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:9">na wumuhaana Nkumbu yivudidi bunene mu nkumbu zimvimba.<verse eid="PHP 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10" />Mwanki mu Nkumbu yi Yesu, bantu bamvimba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:10">baa mu mazulu, ha butoto mpe ku nsye butoto bafukama,<verse eid="PHP 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11" />mpe ndinga zimvimba zibakula ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:11">«Yesu-Klisto ni Mfumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:11">mu dyambu di nkembo wu Nzambi, Tata.»<verse eid="PHP 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lezimeeno bonso kya mu nza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12" />Ni hahoho, zimpangi zani zizola, yeno lukwe ntumiminanga kadi ntangu, ka ha meso mani kaka ko, kansi bwabu mpe, bu nalembolo ba neeno kintwadi, ntumimineeno dyaka buvudidi. Sadileeno mpulusu eno mu kati di bunkuta na kivumi kikingi, <verse eid="PHP 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13" />mu dyambu ti Nzambi kwe luhaananga mpwila na lulendo lwe hidika misamu mimvimba, bonso budi luzolo lwandi.<verse eid="PHP 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14" />Hidikangeeno misamu mimvimba ka mu vunguta mpe ka mu sa mpaka ko, <verse eid="PHP 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15" />mwanki lulembolo ba na kibila na luba bavedila, bonso baala ba Nzambi balembolo ba na kifu ha kati di mbandu beyiyi yivilangana na yimbi. Bika lulezima ha kati dyawu bonso kya mu nza, <verse eid="PHP 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16" />mu banatina Mambu ma luzingu. Ni bwabobo, naakitumpidikila mu yeno mu kilumbu kyaakwiza Klisto, mu dyambu ti ka mumpamba ko nasadidi mpe nayenini mpasi.<verse eid="PHP 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17" />Kati menga mani ni masamuka mu dyambu di munkayulu na kisalu ki kiminu kyeno, nii na kyese mpe nina yangalala na yeno bamvimba. <verse eid="PHP 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18" />Yeno mpe yangalaleeno, yangalaleeno kintwadi naani.<verse eid="PHP 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Timote na Epafotide</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19" />Kivuvu kii naani mu Mfumu Yesu ti, mwa bilumbu kwandi bisidi, naalutambika Timote, mwanki meno mpe nasyamusu mu mpolo zi naabaka mu yeno. <verse eid="PHP 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20" />Mu dyambu ti nii na muntu wuhiika ko wu tulenda kabasana mayindu, wulenda kikwamisa mu kedika mu dyambu dyeno. <verse eid="PHP 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21" />Bantu bamvimba bana sosa kwandi ndandu yi yawu bende, kansi ka yi Yesu-Klisto ko. <verse eid="PHP 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22" />Luzebi ti Timote wulonka bwedi kakihaanina mvimba mu kisalu kye samuna naani Musamu Wumbote bonso tata na mwana andi. <verse eid="PHP 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23" />Nii na kivuvu ti yandi nalutambika bu natumbu yena kya mu musamu ani. <verse eid="PHP 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24" />Nii na kiminu mu Mfumu ti, mwa ntangu yifyoti kwandi yisidi, mebende mpe naakwiza.<verse eid="PHP 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25" />Bumbote nayeni mu lutambika mpangi ani, Epafodite, mukundi ani wu kisalu mpe kwe nwananga mvita naani, wuluntambikidi mwanki kansadisa mu nsatu zani. <verse eid="PHP 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26" />Wuba na mpwila yiyingi mu bwesa luyena yeno bamvimba, mpe wukikwamisa mu dyambu ti luyuwa nsangu zi kimbevo kyandi. <verse eid="PHP 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27" />Wukedika ti wubeela kabedi, lukufi na lufwa, kansi Nzambi wumufwididi kyadi, ka ku yandi kaka ko, kansi na ku meno mpe, mwanki nalembolo ba na kyadi ha yulu kyadi. <verse eid="PHP 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28" />Ni hahoho, nina sila muswalu mu mutambika, mwanki luyangalala bu lwaamuyena na meno mpe nalembolo ba na kyadi kikingi. <verse eid="PHP 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29" />Buna, mu Mfumu, mutambuleeno mu kyese kikingi. Lufweti zangisanga bantu ba bobobo, <verse eid="PHP 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30" />mu dyambu ti ni mu kisalu ki Klisto kabedidi lukufi na lufwa: wuketi hombisa luzingu lwandi mu mpaana lusadusu ha kibuka kyeno mu kisalu kyani.<verse eid="PHP 2:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3" />
  <para style="s1">Kuba wulunungu ha meso ma Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1" />Mpangi zani! Yangalaleeno bu ludi kintwadi na Mfumu. Nina lebakana ko mu vutukila misamu mi nateka lusonikina, mpe buvudidi bumbote mu yeno. <verse eid="PHP 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2" />Kebeeno kweno ku bantu bakwe sanga misamu mimbi, zimbwa zidi, ni yawu mpe bakwe haananga mfunu mu nzengosolo yi bubakala. <verse eid="PHP 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3" />Ni yeto tudi nkatika na nzengosolo yi bubakala yi makedika. Mu dyambu ti, tukwe sadilanga Nzambi mu Mpeve andi, tukwe kitumpidikanga mu Yesu-Klisto, mpe tukwe vula tuulanga kivuvu kyeto mu misamu mi kimuntu ko. <verse eid="PHP 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4" />Mpeleko meno mpe nalenda sosa mu tuula kivuvu kyani mu misamu kimuntu, mpe vudidi bantu bamvimba mu ba na luve mu sosa myo. <verse eid="PHP 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5" />Banzenga bubakala mu kilumbu ki nana ku manima ma mbutukulu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bwabobo Bayudayo bedi sanga, bonso bu na tumina wo Musiku wu Mose. Lulendi tanga mu Mbadukulu 17.12</char></note>. Meno muntu Isaeli nidi, mu kifumba ki Benyami. Nkatika mu Ebeleo wubutu ku ba-Ebeleo. Mu myo mitadidi Misiku, Mufalisi <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lulendi tala mu Mavanga ma zintumwa 23.6; 26.5; Loma 11.1</char></note> naba. <verse eid="PHP 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6" />Mu myo mitadidi vema, naba munkwamisi wu Dibundu. Mu myo mitadidi lunungu lu Misiku, naba kaa na kibila kimosi ko. <verse eid="PHP 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7" />Kansi bima byedi banga ndandu ku meno, bwabu na sala bi yeni mfunu ko mu dyambu di Klisto. <verse eid="PHP 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8" />Nina yena bima bimvimba bonso bima bimpamba, mu dyambu di mbote yivudidi bunene: ni mu zaba Yesu-Klisto Mfumu ani. Mu dyambu dyandi natambula mu hombisa bima bilembolo ba ndandu, mpe nina yena byo bonso dyala, mwanki nabaka Klisto <verse eid="PHP 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9" />mpe nayenika mu yandi ka mu lunungu lu mebende ko, lukwe fumanga mu Misiku, kansi lololo lukwe fumanga mu kiminu mu Klisto. Lunungu lukwe fumanga ku Nzambi ni lololo lu tukwe tambulanga mu kiminu. <verse eid="PHP 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10" />Dyambu dii naani mpwila, ni mu zaba Klisto na lulendo lu mfulukulu lwandi, mu ba kintwadi nandi mu mpasi zandi mpe mu fwanakana nandi mu lufwa lwandi. <verse eid="PHP 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11" />Mpe nii na kivuvu ti meno mpe bamfulukisa mu bafwa.<verse eid="PHP 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ku nooka ntiinu mu baka musendo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12" />Nina ta ko ti meno nanungini hoti neka muntu wulunga, kansi nina tatamana mu nooka ntiinu mu baka musendo, mu dyambu ti mebende Yesu-Klisto wumeni mbwila. <verse eid="PHP 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13" />Zimpangi, meno nina ta ko ti musendo wa nabeki, kansi kima kimosi kwandi nina sa: kuzimbakana misamu mii ku manima mpe kutadisa ku myo mii ku mutwala. <verse eid="PHP 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14" />Ni hahoho, nina nooka ntiinu mu tula natee ku naabaka musendo wututumisina Nzambi mu tambula ku yulu, mu Yesu-Klisto.<verse eid="PHP 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15" />Bwabu yeto bamvimba tudi bakula mu nzila yi Nzambi, tulandeeno ndyatulu beyoyo, mpe tala ti mayindu maswaswana maa neeno mu musamu wumosi, Nzambi waalulonka kikedika ki musamu bewowo. <verse eid="PHP 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16" />Bwabu, mu hohoho ha tweka, tudyatileeno mu kitambi kimosi.<verse eid="PHP 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17" />Zimpangi, yeno bamvimba landeeno nkadulu ani, mpe taleeno yobobo bana dyatila bonso buu kifwani ki luyena mu yeto. <verse eid="PHP 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18" />Mya nateka luteela, mpe mya nina vutukila dyaka mu kati di kidilu: Babingi bana dyatila bonso mitantu mi kulunsi di Klisto. <verse eid="PHP 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19" />Nsukunu awu ni mu zimbala, nzambi awu ni moyo awu, bakwe tuulanga nkembo awu mu myo mikwe bayenisanga nsoni, mpe misamu mi nza beyiyi kaka bakwe yindulanga. <verse eid="PHP 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20" />Kansi yeto, tudi bantu ba mazulu, ku tuna kingila nyizulu yi Muvuukisi eto, Mfumu Yesu-Klisto. <verse eid="PHP 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21" />Waakitula nitu eto yimpamba yikwe fwanga, mwanki kafwanikisa yo na nitu andi yi nkembo, mu nzila yi lulendo lukwe muhaananga luve mu tuula bima bimvimba ku nsye luyalu lwandi.<verse eid="PHP 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1" />Mpangi zani zizola, Nkatika nsatu yii naani mu luyena dyaka! Yeno lukwe nyangidikanga na ludi musendo wu kisalu kyani. Bakundi bani, beeno bakangama mu kintwadi na Mfumu.<verse eid="PHP 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ntumunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2" />Nina syamisa Evodi na Sintike, bazinga mu nyuwasani mu kati di kintwadi kyawu na Mfumu. <verse eid="PHP 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3" />Ngeye mpe mukundi ani wu kisalu wukwikama, nina kulomba wubasadisa, mu dyambu ti banweni ha kimosi naani mu samuna Musamu Wumbote, bumosi mpe na Kelima na bakundi bani bahiika ba kisalu mu Mfumu, kadi nkumbu zawu zii zisonama mu buuku di luzingu.<verse eid="PHP 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4" />Yangalaleeno ntangu zimvimba mu Mfumu. Mbwesi ta dyaka: yangalaleeno!<verse eid="PHP 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5" />Bika mbelo eno yi kizunu yizabakana ku bantu bamvimba. Mfumu weka lukufi. <verse eid="PHP 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6" />Lukikwamisangandi mu kani kima ko, kansi mu mimvimba, zabikisangeeno nsatu zeno ku Nzambi mu zinsambulu na mu zindombolo. Na, muvutudilangeeno mpe matondo. <verse eid="PHP 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7" />Bika kiyenge ki Nzambi kihyokidi madyela mamvimba, kikeba mitima na mabanza meno mu Yesu-Klisto.<verse eid="PHP 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8" />Zimpangi, mu manisa, bika mabanza meno maba mu misamu mimvimba mikedika, mi buzitu, milunungu, mivedila, mizolakana, mi kikumu kimbote, mpe mimvimba mimbote na mi bakwe siikanga. <verse eid="PHP 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9" />Sadileeno misamu mi lulongokidi na mi lutambudi ku meno, myo mi luyuwa mina ta mpe myo mi luyena mina sa. Mpe Nzambi yikwe haananga kiyenge waaba neeno.<verse eid="PHP 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mvutudulu yi matondo yi Pawuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10" />Natomini yangalala bubwingi mu Mfumu mu dyambu ti lulonkidi dyaka luzolo lweno mu meno. Luzolo belolo luba neeno, kansi lubaka hwakisa dye ndonkisa lo ko. <verse eid="PHP 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11" />Ka mu dyambu di nsatu yi bima ko nina zonzila bobo, mu dyambu ti nkwe yangalalanga mu byo bii naani. <verse eid="PHP 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12" />Nzebi mu zinga mu bumputu na nzebi mpe mu zinga mu kimvwama. Mu bibuka bimvimba na mu mimvimba, nalongoka mu ba wuyukuta na mu fwa nsatu, mu ba na bimvwama na mu lembolo ba na kima. <verse eid="PHP 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13" />Nkwe lendanga mu hidika mimvimba mu lusadusu lu Klisto kwe mpaananga ngolo. <verse eid="PHP 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14" />Kansi, bumbote lusidi bu lunsadisi mu mpasi zani.<verse eid="PHP 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15" />Bisi-Filipi, yeno bende walutomini zaba: bu nakatuka ku kizunga ki Masedwani, mu ntangu yitona mu samuna Musamu Wumbote, kuba nakani Dibundu dimosi di nsadisa ko, yeno kwandi kaka lunsadisa mu nsatu zani. <verse eid="PHP 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16" />Mu ntangu yi naba ku mbanza Tesalonika, ka nkumbu yimosi kaka ko luntambikila lusadusu, mu byo bi ba naani nsatu. <verse eid="PHP 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17" />Didyandi ko ti minkayulu nina sosa, kansi nina sosa ti lubaka ndandu yivudidi mu kisalu kyeno. <verse eid="PHP 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18" />Bima bimvimba bi luntambikidi byanabeki, nii na byo bihyoka kitezo. Natomini yangalala mu tambula minkayulu mi luntambikidi ku Epafodite, mii bonso mananasi ma mfuku yimbote. Nzambi kwe tambulanga munkayulu bewowo na wukwe mu yangidikanga. <verse eid="PHP 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19" />Nzambi ani waaluhaana bimvimba bii neeno nsatu, bonso budi bunene bu kimvwama andi mu Yesu-Klisto. <verse eid="PHP 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20" />Nkembo ku Nzambi, Tata dyeto, mimvu ka mimvu! Ameni!<verse eid="PHP 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbote zimansukina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21" />Haaneeno mbote ku bantu bamvimba bavwihulu ku Nzambi mu Yesu-Klisto. Mpangi zii naani mpe, balutambikidi mbote. <verse eid="PHP 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22" />Bantu bamvimba bavwihulu ku Nzambi balutambikidi mbote, sungula yobobo bakwe salanga mu nzo yi ntinu Kayisali.<verse eid="PHP 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23" />Bika Mfumu Yesu-Klisto kalusakumuna!<verse eid="PHP 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4" />
</usx>